  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6fc8f370ee97db428fdd35074d55550, type: 3}
  m_Name: HigherLower1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  Sentences:
  - Text: Looks like I found the blue triplet.
    emotion: 0
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Correct! We may now begin my awesome number game.
    emotion: 1
    name: Blue Triplet
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: You see, I have a lucky number of my own, and you're gonna have to guess
      it in a game of Higher or Lower.
    emotion: 0
    name: Blue Triplet
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: The rules are simple. You say a number, and I'll tell you if you are higher
      or lower than my lucky number.
    emotion: 0
    name: Blue Triplet
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: You will have 15 tries to get the correct number. If you fail, we will
      simple start over.
    emotion: 0
    name: Blue Triplet
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Oh, and don't think you can look up the number somewhere else! My number
      is lucky because it's different all the time.
    emotion: 0
    name: Blue Triplet
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: What is with you guys and having random lucky numbers?
    emotion: 6
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  - Text: Well, the rules sound simple enough. Let's go.
    emotion: 0
    name: Penny
    sound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b6bfe88825810c4dabfb90539aad45e, type: 3}
  Character1: {fileID: 0}
  Character2: {fileID: 0}
  canPlayerMove: 0
  opening: 0
  minigameTransition: 1
  minigameNumber: 0
